  "score_support_basis": "The rationale assigns score 3, arguing the comment has explicit actions but vague implementation. However, several specific concrete details are present (shortening a specific paragraph in Section 1, adding more details on long-tailed dataset generation, using more pages for important experiments). The gold label is 5 (explicit + concrete), and the rationale's own analysis acknowledges multiple explicit actions. The rationale underweights the concreteness of the suggestions but ultimately the rubric mapping to 3 rather than 5 reflects rubric misapplication rather than complete misalignment.",
